@host = http://localhost:8080
@adminAccessToken = replace-with-admin-access-token

### Admin logs search - 기본 검색 (biz-events, level=ERROR)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "level:ERROR AND service:api-server",
  "filters": [
    { "field": "service", "value": "api-server", "negate": false }
  ],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "size": 50
}

### Admin logs search - 필터 없이 전체 시간 범위 조회
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "all",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T01:00:00Z"
  },
  "size": 20
}

### Admin logs search - 다중 필터 + negate 사용
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "error-logs",
  "query": "level:(ERROR OR WARN)",
  "filters": [
    { "field": "service", "value": "api-server", "negate": false },
    { "field": "event_name", "value": "health_check", "negate": true }
  ],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "size": 100
}

### Admin logs search - 트레이스 ID 단건 추적
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "all",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [
    { "field": "trace_id", "value": "00-1a2b3c4d5e6f7890abcdef0123456789-1234567890abcdef-01", "negate": false }
  ],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T01:00:00Z"
  },
  "size": 200
}

### Admin logs search - searchAfter 페이지네이션 (2페이지)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "level:ERROR",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "size": 50,
  "searchAfter": ["2026-05-14T23:59:59Z", "doc-50"]
}

### Admin logs histogram - 1시간 구간(자동 30s 버킷)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/histogram
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T01:00:00Z"
  }
}

### Admin logs histogram - 24시간 구간(자동 5m 버킷)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/histogram
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "error-logs",
  "query": "level:ERROR",
  "filters": [
    { "field": "service", "value": "api-server", "negate": false }
  ],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  }
}

### Admin logs histogram - 7일 구간(자동 1h 버킷)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/histogram
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "all",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-08T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  }
}

### Admin logs field-summary - 단일 필드(service)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/field-summary
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "fields": ["service"]
}

### Admin logs field-summary - 다중 필드(service, level, event_name)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/field-summary
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "all",
  "query": "level:ERROR",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "fields": ["service", "level", "event_name", "error.type"]
}

### Admin logs field-summary - room_id, trace_id 집계
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/field-summary
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "event_name:relay_*",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "fields": ["room_id", "trace_id"]
}

### Admin logs search - 인증 누락(401, ADMIN_LOGS_UNAUTHORIZED)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "size": 10
}

### Admin logs search - 허용되지 않은 index(400, ADMIN_LOGS_INVALID_INDEX)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "unknown-logs",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "size": 10
}

### Admin logs search - 금지된 DSL 키(400, ADMIN_LOGS_INVALID_QUERY)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "script": { "source": "ctx._source.level='ERROR'" },
  "size": 10
}

### Admin logs search - 시간 범위 30일 초과(400, ADMIN_LOGS_INVALID_TIME_RANGE)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-04-01T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "size": 10
}

### Admin logs field-summary - 허용되지 않은 field(400, ADMIN_LOGS_INVALID_FIELD)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/field-summary
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "fields": ["password"]
}
